  "slug": "hometown",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/17296_hometown.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I have a friend whose hometown is not this city. He often said that his hometown is very different from this city. I thought he would be unhappy because his family was not here. But he told me that no matter where I am, as long as I have good neighbors and good friends, I feel like I am at home. He also often speaks his hometown dialect, which I find so interesting that I must learn a few words."
  ],
  "english_full": "I have a friend whose hometown is not this city. He often said that his hometown is very different from this city. I thought he would be unhappy because his family was not here. But he told me that no matter where I am, as long as I have good neighbors and good friends, I feel like I am at home. He also often speaks his hometown dialect, which I find so interesting that I must learn a few words.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "У меня́ есть дру́г, чей родно́й го́род не э́тот го́род. Он ча́сто ска́зал, что его родно́й го́род са́мый друго́й, чем э́тот го́род. Я ду́мал, что он бу́дет несча́стный, потому что его семья́ не здесь. Но он ска́зал мне, что безотносительно от того́, где я, е́сли то́лько у ме́ня хоро́шие сосе́ди и хоро́шие дру́зья, мне хоте́лось бы бы́ть до́ма. Он та́кже ча́сто говори́т на своём диале́кте, кото́рый я нахо́жу интере́сным, что́бы я до́лжен вы́учить не́сколько слова́."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "U meńya yest́ drúg, chéy rodnóy górod ne étot górod. On chásto skázal, chto ego rodnóy górod sámyy drugóy, chem étot górod. Ya dúmal, chto on búdet neschástnyy, potomu chto ego semyá ne zdeś. No on skázal mne, chto bezotnositeĺno ot tógo, gde ya, ésĺi tóĺko u ménya khoróshie sosed́i i khoróshie drúzya, mne khóteloś by být́ dóma. On tákzhe chásto govoŕit na svóyom diaĺekte, kotóryy ya nakhózh́u interésnym, chtóby ya dólzhen výuchit́ néskoĺko slová."
  ],
